  Name: District E buildings
  Type: 1
  Image: {fileID: 0}
  Description: "District E is a transformative three-tower development poised to
    redefine the entrance to Eindhoven. Rising up to 140 meters directly across from
    the Central Station, this project addresses the city\u2019s urgent housing shortage
    by adding over 700 diverse apartments to the Brainport core. By replacing a paved
    transit square with lush \"urban forests\" and a 4,500-space bicycle hub, the
    towers act as a sustainable gateway that prioritizes people over cars. This high-density
    hub isn't just about height; it\u2019s a strategic effort to turn a transit \"dead
    zone\" into a vibrant, climate-resilient neighborhood where tech professionals
    and locals can connect in public gardens and glass-walled cafes. Once finished,
    District E will serve as the heartbeat of a modernized, vertical Eindhoven."
